WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.520
ANTHONY HOPKINS, WHO'S DONE
PRETTY DAMN WELL FOR HIMSELF,

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.800
ESPECIALLY THIS YEAR, SAID, "THE
MINUTE I PUT ON THE WARDROBE,

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.480
THE CHARACTER JUST UNFOLDS.”

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.880
"EMMA'S" ALEXANDRA BYRNE HAD THE
CHALLENGE OF DESIGNING COSTUMES

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.440
FOR A FILM SET IN THE EARLY
19TH CENTURY.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.520
TO MEET THAT CHALLENGE SHE
LOOKED AT EVERYTHING.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.920
PAINTINGS, JOURNALS, AND
EVEN IN MUSEUMS.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:24.000
TO PREPARE FOR "MA RAINEY'S
BLACK BOTTOM," COSTUME DESIGNER

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.600
ANN ROTH READS THE SCRIPT, AND
ASKS HERSELF QUESTIONS ABOUT THE

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.880
CHARACTER LIKE, "WHEN SHE GOES TO
BED, WHERE ARE THOSE CLOTHES?

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.120
DO THEY FALL ON THE FLOOR?
DOES SHE HANG THEM UP?"

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.800
FROM THERE, ANN BUILDS THE
COSTUMES WHICH DEFINE THE CHARACTER.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.360
FOR "MANK," TRISH SUMMERVILLE

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.400
USED SEARS AND ROEBUCK
CATALOGUES, CHARLIE CHAPLIN

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.400
MOVIES, AND STILL PHOTOGRAPHS
FROM THE '20S, '30S AND '40S TO

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.200
CREATE AN AUTHENTIC LOOK OF REAL
PEOPLE FROM MOVIE HISTORY.

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.160
BINA DAIGELER SPENT THREE WEEKS
IN CHINA RESEARCHING COSTUMES

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.560
FOR "MULAN."
SHE SAID HER GOAL WAS TO ENABLE

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.520
THE AUDIENCE TO GRASP SOMETHING
ESSENTIAL ABOUT THE CHARACTER.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.720
AND IN THE CASE OF "MULAN"
HERSELF, SHE USED COLOR AND

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.600
COSTUME TO CONVEY AN UPLIFTING
AND POSITIVE MESSAGE.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.720
"PINOCCHIO'S" COSTUME DESIGNER
MASSIMO CANTINI PARRINI ALSO IS

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:13.760
A STRONG BELIEVER THAT COLOR
HELPS CREATE THE CHARACTER.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.560
AND BECAUSE RED IS THE COLOR
THAT EXPRESSES POWERFUL EMOTIONS

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:20.880
LIKE ANGER, PASSION, LOVE, AND
LYING, "PINOCCHIO" BECAME THE

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.560
ONLY CHARACTER IN
THE MOVIE WEARING RED.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:26.840
AND THE OSCAR GOES TO --

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.720
ANN ROTH,
"MA RAINEY'S BLACK BOTTOM."

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:33.600
[ APPLAUSE ]

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.600
THE ACADEMY
CONGRATULATES ANN ROTH

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:37.360
AND ACCEPTS THE OSCAR
ON HER BEHALF.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.338
THANK YOU.

